#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-sync-stripe-webhook-for-mode.php:14
msgid ""
"Stripe cannot reach local-only webhook URLs (like .test/.local). Use a "
"public tunnel URL for webhook testing, or use Stripe CLI forwarding while "
"testing locally."
msgstr ""
"استرایپ نمی‌تواند به URLهای وب‌هوک محلی (مانند .test/.local) دسترسی پیدا "
